<view class="container">
  <view class="card bg-info">
    <view class="level-info">核对一下再出结论</view>
    <view class="muted small">小字号的数字容易看错一位，差一个零结论就反了。有不对的直接改。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{识别备注.length}}">
    <view class="card-title">识别时遇到的情况</view>
    <view class="muted small" wx:for="{{识别备注}}" wx:key="*this">· {{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">基本信息</view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="muted">商品名称</text>
      <input value="{{商品名称}}" data-field="商品名称" bindinput="改字段" placeholder="可不填" style="text-align:right;flex:1;margin-left:24rpx;"/>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="muted">SC 号</text>
      <input value="{{SC号}}" data-field="SC号" bindinput="改字段" placeholder="如 SC1061..." style="text-align:right;flex:1;margin-left:24rpx;"/>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="muted">执行标准</text>
      <input value="{{执行标准}}" data-field="执行标准" bindinput="改字段" placeholder="如 GB/T 20977" style="text-align:right;flex:1;margin-left:24rpx;"/>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">营养成分表的基准</view>
    <view class="muted small">这一项抄错，所有数值都会算错</view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{基准选项}}" range-key="文案" value="{{基准索引}}" bindchange="改基准">
      <view class="row"><text>基准</text><text class="level-info">{{基准选项[基准索引].文案}} ›</text></view>
    </picker>
    <view class="row" wx:if="{{基准选项[基准索引].值 === 'perServing'}}">
      <text class="muted">每份重量</text>
      <input type="digit" value="{{份重}}" data-field="份重" bindinput="改字段" placeholder="必填" style="text-align:right;flex:1;margin-left:24rpx;"/>
      <text class="muted">{{份重单位}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">营养成分</view>
    <view class="muted small">没印在包装上的留空，留空表示「未知」，不会被当成 0</view>
    <view class="row" wx:for="{{营养项}}" wx:key="名称">
      <text class="muted">{{item.名称}}</text>
      <input type="digit" value="{{item.值}}" data-idx="{{index}}" bindinput="改营养" placeholder="—" style="text-align:right;flex:1;margin-left:24rpx;"/>
      <text class="muted" style="width:70rpx;text-align:right;">{{item.单位}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">配料表</view>
    <textarea value="{{配料文本}}" data-field="配料文本" bindinput="改字段"
              placeholder="各成分以顿号分隔" auto-height
              style="width:100%;min-height:120rpx;font-size:28rpx;"/>
  </view>

  <view class="card bg-warn" wx:if="{{错误}}"><text class="level-warn">{{错误}}</text></view>

  <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="确认" disabled="{{提交中}}">
    {{提交中 ? '分析中…' : '确认无误，出结论'}}
  </button>
</view>
